o_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440_1.png", "id": "278768610454753", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210888_278768613788086_3110901518997185047_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UGgQs3nYhqIQ7kNvwEbGaE9&_nc_oc=Adr87z3QczIfnXLft5GDvjcc29c4UDRRG2daz4QYmVmTFJ9cdTu_JoMjtfG_AvZ_tx0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRbBYidEDlf-VP2blrxNX-8Grb0WvdEc_cRpistHaPyXQ&oe=6AFC88C2"}, "display_name": "Candy Puzzle Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Full Version : https://www.oculus.com/experiences/quest/4058005747577896/\n\nFamiliar to play, yet challenging to master, Candy Puzzle brings fresh mind-bending challenges and unanticipated obstacles to the casual phenomenon loved by everyone! Keep your brain fit and boost your problem-solving skills by mastering the tricky levels based on real-life physics. Tired of mind game? Just sit/stand back and enjoy the cheerful and relaxing game atmosphere of one of the most beautiful game for everyone.\n\n=== Features ===\n- Easy to challenging levels\n- 50+ levels in full version\n- Amazing relaxing music and environment\n- 90Hz support\n\nNote: We will add more levels in future updates", "short_description": "Familiar to play, yet challenging to master, Candy Puzzle brings fresh mind-bending challenges and unanticipated obstacles to the casual phenomenon loved by everyone! Keep your brain fit and boost your problem-solving skills by mastering the tricky levels based on real-life physics. Tired of mind game? Just sit/stand back and enjoy the cheerful and relaxing game atmosphere of one of the most beautiful game for everyone."}]}, "developer_name": "Thunder Game Development Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://thundergamestudio.com/policy/metapolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Thunder Game Development Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://thundergam